# Room 15: the Cloud, at the top of the beanstalk. White ground with
# edges, and on it a mainframe: tape cabinets, a panel of lights, a room
# of its own, time for rent. Far below, the kingdom.
# The Cloud is a ring of overlapping puffs. Nothing inside it is filled:
# white is what a picture starts as. Generated once, then kept by hand.

# ---- sky: three shades, the sun, stars later ----
